{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xS8E18uwTt1795652651.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港鐵天水圍站較早前有工程車設備故障，屯馬綫列車服務一度延誤。</p><p></p><p>在清晨約5時50分，港鐵指天水圍站有工程車設備故障，候車時間預計比平日多10至15分鐘。</p><p></p><p>而來往屯門至元朗預計25分鐘一班，來往元朗至烏溪沙8分鐘一班。期間，港鐵提供免費接駁巴士，來往元朗站和屯門站，途經沿途各站。</p><p></p><p>港鐵工程人員其後將涉事工程車移離行車線並進行檢查，到接近6時20分，屯馬綫列車服務逐步回復正常。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T00:57:56.138457+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T22:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.105561+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T00:51:17.047987+00:00","content_hash":"43b5400620a416ccc04e01de1ed01c696e3a5e9439f2131152833a2476481253","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T00:57:56.138457+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}